  "specId": "286-plugin-foundation-runtime",
  "issue": 373,
  "request": "Goal: implement the shared plugin foundation required before workflow and preset extraction. Scope: add runtime support for installed plugin hook discovery, validation, snapshotting into flow.json, hook execution through a public context, plugin command factory loading and help metadata, plugin config namespace/default merging, installer known-path copying instead of plugin.json files, and plugin sources/packages configuration separation. Out of Scope: do not migrate workflow or preset implementations to external repositories, do not convert existing registry hooks into classes, and do not add npm source support beyond validation boundaries. Description: this spec prepares core contracts and tests so later workflow and preset plugins can run without importing core internal paths or relying on workflow/preset-specific core code.",
